SUMMARY:Drive Change at St. Mike's Golf Classic 2026
DESCRIPTION:Whether you’re a longtime golfer or just in it for the camaraderie and college spirit\, the USMC Golf Classic is a fantastic opportunity to spend a high-end day on the green with classmates\, colleagues\, and friends — all while supporting St. Mike’s students. Proceeds from the tournament go to the President’s Excellence Fund which enriches student life\, allowing students to experience all that Canada’s leading Catholic university has to offer. \n\n\n\nThe alumni green fee is $1\,800 per foursome and is exclusively available to alumni participants\, which includes 18 holes of championship-level golf\, player gifts\, meals\, and tournament-day hospitality. \n\n\n\nFind out more and sign up now: https://usmcgolfclassic.com/
URL:https://stmikes.utoronto.ca/event/drive-change-at-st-mikes-golf-classic-2026
LOCATION:Eagles Nest Golf Club\, 10000 Dufferin St\, Maple\, Ontario\, Canada
END:VEVENT
