UID:10007555-1790623800-1790627400@stmikes.utoronto.ca
SUMMARY:St. Michael's Schola Cantorum: Michaelmas Concert
DESCRIPTION:The St. Michael’s Schola Cantorum’s first concert of the year will feature the luminous and consoling Fauré Requiem\, offered in memory of all of the deceased members of the St. Michael’s community. The concert is directed by Dr. Christina Labriola\, with soprano Dr. Lindsay McIntyre\, baritone Paul Winkelmans\, Dr. John-Paul Farahat on organ\, and string quintet led by Rezan Onen-Lapointe. The event is free and open to all\, with donations welcome.
URL:https://stmikes.utoronto.ca/event/st-michaels-schola-cantorum-michaelmas-concert
LOCATION:St. Basil’s Church\, 50 St. Joseph Street\, Toronto\, Ontario\, Canada
END:VEVENT
